
@host = http://localhost:5213

### 1. Ping
GET {{host}}/ping

### 2. List inventory
GET {{host}}/api/inventory

### 3. Route that does not exist
GET {{host}}/api/nothing

### 4. Wrong HTTP method
POST {{host}}/api/inventory

### 5. Get one item
GET {{host}}/api/inventory/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### 6. Unknown id
GET {{host}}/api/inventory/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999

### 4. Wrong verb
DELETE {{host}}/api/inventory


### 7. Create
POST {{host}}/api/inventory
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "WC-009",
  "name": "Webcam",
  "description": "1080p",
  "quantity": 12,
  "price": 59.00
}


### 9. Delete
DELETE {{host}}/api/inventory/33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333




